    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a nice sunny day in Tor Borgh and aimless lout Geoff Dandy is woken up by his best mate Dolph Dombardo raging incoherently about going to the Jiggly Swamp. Saving Dolph from doom sets in motion events that lead to one question...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the Crypt of Darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GENRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Old School Inspired RPG Nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME INFO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic RPG gameplay with a Shining Force inspired tactics battle system. Level up system allows you to customize your character stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PROS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a0Characters and events change as the adventure unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a0Strategy battle system inspired by Shining Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/3116361b9eeb19dcc8b9cf917aa7fbd4.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a0No yappers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/b44c04650166727dfcaa914e671f5cc7.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a04 hour play time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/b44c04650166727dfcaa914e671f5cc7.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a0Needlessly complicated plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108630/extras/b44c04650166727dfcaa914e671f5cc7.webp?t=1728808222\" /></div> \u00a0Not retro style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
